      "instance_name": "gun_control_debate",
      "label": "Gun Control Debate",
      "description": "A real-world political and social issue in the United States concerning the regulation of firearms, including debates over Second Amendment rights, public safety, and the balance between individual self-defense and collective security. The meme references this debate by implying that gun control measures are a threat to personal safety.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
