      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "gun_ownership_as_right",
      "label": "Gun Ownership as a Right",
      "description": "The belief that individuals have a fundamental right to own firearms, often tied to constitutional rights like the Second Amendment. This concept is central to the meme's argument that gun control undermines personal safety and freedom.",
